{
  "info": {
    "name": "SnackRapido - Notifications Service",
    "description": "Testing the Notifications microservice via the RabbitMQ Management HTTP API.\n\nThe notifications service is a pure RabbitMQ consumer (no HTTP server).\nMessages are published directly to the queue using the RabbitMQ Management API on port 15673.\n\nPrerequisites:\n1. Docker services running (docker-compose up -d)\n2. Notifications service running (npx nx serve api-notifications)\n3. RabbitMQ Management UI: http://localhost:15673 (admin/rabbit123)\n\nHow it works:\n- Each request publishes a JSON event to the notifications_queue\n- The notifications service picks it up via @EventPattern\n- Check service logs to verify processing\n- Check MongoDB (mongo-express: http://localhost:8091) to verify DB records",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "rabbitMqUrl",
      "value": "http://localhost:15673"
    },
    {
      "key": "rabbitMqUser",
      "value": "admin"
    },
    {
      "key": "rabbitMqPass",
      "value": "rabbit123"
    },
    {
      "key": "queue",
      "value": "notifications_queue"
    },
    {
      "key": "vhost",
      "value": "%2F"
    },
    {
      "key": "customerId",
      "value": "PASTE_USER_ID_FROM_USERS_SERVICE"
    },
    {
      "key": "restaurantId",
      "value": "PASTE_RESTAURANT_ID"
    }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Health Check",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "RabbitMQ Management API Health",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('RabbitMQ Management API is reachable', () => {",
                  "    pm.expect(pm.response.code).to.be.oneOf([200, 401]);",
                  "});",
                  "if (pm.response.code === 200) {",
                  "    const res = pm.response.json();",
                  "    pm.test('RabbitMQ is running', () => {",
                  "        pm.expect(res).to.have.property('rabbitmq_version');",
                  "    });",
                  "    console.log('RabbitMQ version:', res.rabbitmq_version);",
                  "}"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "auth": {
              "type": "basic",
              "basic": [
                { "key": "username", "value": "{{rabbitMqUser}}" },
                { "key": "password", "value": "{{rabbitMqPass}}" }
              ]
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{rabbitMqUrl}}/api/overview",
              "host": ["{{rabbitMqUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "overview"]
            },
            "description": "Verify the RabbitMQ Management API is accessible. Should return RabbitMQ version info."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Check Notifications Queue",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Queue info retrieved', () => {",
                  "    pm.expect(pm.response.code).to.equal(200);",
                  "});",
                  "if (pm.response.code === 200) {",
                  "    const q = pm.response.json();",
                  "    console.log('Queue:', q.name);",
                  "    console.log('Messages ready:', q.messages_ready);",
                  "    console.log('Consumers:', q.consumers);",
                  "    pm.test('Notifications service is consuming (consumers > 0)', () => {",
                  "        pm.expect(q.consumers).to.be.greaterThan(0);",
                  "    });",
                  "}"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "auth": {
              "type": "basic",
              "basic": [
                { "key": "username", "value": "{{rabbitMqUser}}" },
                { "key": "password", "value": "{{rabbitMqPass}}" }
              ]
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{rabbitMqUrl}}/api/queues/{{vhost}}/{{queue}}",
              "host": ["{{rabbitMqUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "queues", "{{vhost}}", "{{queue}}"]
            },
            "description": "Check the notifications_queue status. 'consumers' should be > 0 when the notifications service is running."
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Order Events",
      "description": "Publish order-related events to trigger notifications",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "1. order.placed",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Event published successfully', () => {",
                  "    pm.expect(pm.response.code).to.equal(200);",
                  "});",
                  "console.log('✅ order.placed event published. Check notifications service logs.');"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
            ],
            "auth": {
              "type": "basic",
              "basic": [
                { "key": "username", "value": "{{rabbitMqUser}}" },
                { "key": "password", "value": "{{rabbitMqPass}}" }
              ]
            },
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"routing_key\": \"notifications_queue\",\n  \"payload\": \"{\\\"pattern\\\":\\\"order.placed\\\",\\\"data\\\":{\\\"orderId\\\":\\\"order_001\\\",\\\"orderNumber\\\":\\\"ORD-2026-001\\\",\\\"customerId\\\":\\\"{{customerId}}\\\",\\\"total\\\":\\\"45.99 TND\\\",\\\"deliveryType\\\":\\\"DELIVERY\\\",\\\"deliveryAddress\\\":\\\"123 Main St, Tunis\\\",\\\"metadata\\\":{\\\"customerEmail\\\":\\\"testuser@example.com\\\",\\\"customerName\\\":\\\"Test User\\\",\\\"restaurantName\\\":\\\"Pizza Palace\\\",\\\"estimatedDeliveryTime\\\":\\\"2026-03-21T14:30:00Z\\\"}}}\",\n  \"payload_encoding\": \"string\",\n  \"properties\": {\n    \"content_type\": \"application/json\",\n    \"delivery_mode\": 2\n  }\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": { "language": "json" }
              }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{rabbitMqUrl}}/api/exchanges/{{vhost}}//publish",
              "host": ["{{rabbitMqUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "exchanges", "{{vhost}}", "", "publish"]
            },
            "description": "Publishes an order.placed event. The notifications service will:\n1. Create a Notification record in MongoDB\n2. Send an email to the customer (if SMTP configured)\n3. Log a push notification (mock)\n\nCheck service logs for: '📦 Order placed event received'"
          }
        },
